  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Aroura Charitable Society Grant - re-coding</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The Irish Representative Office in Ramallah, through the Palestine Head of Mission Fund, will support&#xa0;Aroura Charitable Society, aiming to support women empowerment. This project aims at supporting and empowering women in the village of Aroura, located near Ramallah. It focuses on women who are experiencing social and economic difficulties&#x2014;such as widows, divorcees, single mothers, and unemployed female graduates. The programme offers psychological support to enhance mental health and self-esteem, in addition to vocational training in skills such as sewing, soap and candle production, cooking, and more. It fosters financial independence, enhances quality of life, and encourages community participation.</narrative>
  </description>
